        "q": "What is the eligibility criteria to apply for Axis Bank Fibe Credit Card?",
        "a": "In general, Indian residents between the age of 18 and 70 years can apply for this card. However, the criteria may vary based on factors such as credit score, monthly income, etc."
      },
      {
        "q": "What is the Wednesday Delight offer on Axis Bank Fibe Credit Card?",
        "a": "The card offers great deals every Wednesday on top brands like Goibibo & MakeMyTrip (up to 15% savings on flights & hotels), Tira (10% off), Swiggy and Amazon Fresh (10% off)."
      },
      {
        "q": "What is the forex transaction fee on this credit card?",
        "a": "The card charges a foreign currency transaction fee of 3.5% of the transaction amount."
      },
      {
        "q": "Does the card offer international airport lounge access?",
        "a": "No, Axis Bank Fibe credit card does not offer international airport lounge access. However, cardholders get up to 4 complimentary domestic lounge access every year."
      },
      {
        "q": "Is Axis Bank Fibe Credit Card free?",
        "a": "Yes, Axis Bank Fibe Credit Card is a lifetime free credit card, offered without any joining or annual fee."
      }
